---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Become a Masseuse · Private WINKS London application" description="Apply privately to work with WINKS London. Upload your images and supporting documents through the confidential application form.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="page-hero__watermark">PRIVATE</span><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4 page-hero__content"><div class="breadcrumb-line"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/contact">Contact</a><span>/</span><span class="current">Become a masseuse</span></div><span class="eyebrow mt-4">Private partner route</span><h1>Work with<br /><em>WINKS.</em></h1><p>WINKS keeps its network private. This form is reviewed confidentially and no profile is published without your written permission.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--line"><div class="container-fluid px-3 px-lg-4"><div class="content-grid"><div class="form-shell"><div class="form-shell__header"><h2>Private application</h2><span>Confidential · no public roster</span></div><div class="form-shell__body"><form data-demo-form data-success-message="Thank you — your private application has been received. The WINKS team will be in touch." enctype="multipart/form-data" novalidate><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-name">Full name</label><input class="form-control" id="app-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-preferred">Preferred working name</label><input class="form-control" id="app-preferred" name="preferred_name" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-email">Email</label><input class="form-control" id="app-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-phone">Phone / WhatsApp</label><input class="form-control" id="app-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-city">Base area</label><input class="form-control" id="app-city" name="area" placeholder="e.g. Central London" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-experience">Relevant experience</label><select class="form-select" id="app-experience" name="experience" required><option value="" selected disabled>Select one</option><option>New to the industry</option><option>Under 2 years</option><option>2–5 years</option><option>5+ years</option></select></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="app-availability">Availability / preferred hours</label><input class="form-control" id="app-availability" name="availability" placeholder="e.g. evenings, weekends, flexible" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-photos">Photos</label><input class="form-control" id="app-photos" name="photos" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple required /><p class="form-note mt-2">Up to 5 current images. JPG, PNG or WebP.</p></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="app-id">Supporting ID / documents</label><input class="form-control" id="app-id" name="documents" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,application/pdf" multiple required /><p class="form-note mt-2">PDF or image. Upload securely in production.</p></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label" for="app-note">Tell us a little about yourself</label><textarea class="form-control" id="app-note" name="note" rows="5" required></textarea></div><div class="col-12"><div class="form-check"><input class="form-check-input" id="app-consent" type="checkbox" required /><label class="form-check-label" for="app-consent">I confirm I am 18 or over and understand this is a private application, not a public listing.</label></div></div><div class="col-12"><button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Send private application <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="form-note mt-3">Prototype note: connect this form to a secure, encrypted upload endpoint before launch.</p></div><div class="col-12"><div class="form-success" data-form-success role="status"></div></div></div></form></div></div><aside class="content-aside"><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">Our privacy promise</span><h3>No public therapist section.</h3><p>As requested, WINKS does not show massage therapist profiles, names or galleries anywhere in the public site.</p><ul class="aside-list"><li>Applications are private</li><li>No profile without permission</li><li>Images used only as agreed</li></ul></div></aside></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
